{
  "format": "libre-panel-theme/1",
  "name": "Lit demo",
  "author": "Libre Panel contributors",
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "description": "DEMO, may be removed: SPUR II's look built from core widgets on the 1920x480 bar. Lit rings and bars, graphs whose line is light, the grid background and the panel light (the sun glints on the frames, sweeps run across at start and on the hour).",
